{"id":"69109041e60f84f6","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating.md","title":"Toyama 的终止性非模块反例","display":"ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating — Toyama 的终止性非模块反例","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating","aliases":["56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating"],"display":"ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating — Toyama 的终止性非模块反例","depends_on":["[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_section":"§5.9 Example 5.9.1","source_printed_pages":"174","source_ocr_blocks":[195],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating — Toyama 的终止性非模块反例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.9 Example 5.9.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"174"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{or},\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\">\\(\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{or},\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\)</span> 为四个互异函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是与它们不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne y\">\\(x\\ne y\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigSum}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigSum}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminating}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\\coloneqq(\\{\\mathsf F,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\},\\{(\\mathsf F,3),(\\mathbf0,0),(\\mathbf1,0)\\}),\\qquad\\Sigma_1\\coloneqq(\\{\\mathsf{or}\\},\\{(\\mathsf{or},2)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0\\coloneqq(\\{\\mathsf F,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\},\\{(\\mathsf F,3),(\\mathbf0,0),(\\mathbf1,0)\\}),\\qquad\\Sigma_1\\coloneqq(\\{\\mathsf{or}\\},\\{(\\mathsf{or},2)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x),\\mathsf F(x,x,x))\\},\\qquad R_1\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf{or}(x,y),x),(\\mathsf{or}(x,y),y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x),\\mathsf F(x,x,x))\\},\\qquad R_1\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf{or}(x,y),x),(\\mathsf{or}(x,y),y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),\\quad T_i\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_i,V),\\quad T\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\quad\\to_i\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\quad\\to\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R_0\\cup R_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SigSum}(\\Sigma_0,\\Sigma_1),\\quad T_i\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_i,V),\\quad T\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\quad\\to_i\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma_i,V,R_i),\\quad\\to\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R_0\\cup R_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\coloneqq\\mathsf{or}(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1),\\quad t_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(a,a,a),\\quad t_1\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,a,a),\\quad t_2\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\coloneqq\\mathsf{or}(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1),\\quad t_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(a,a,a),\\quad t_1\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,a,a),\\quad t_2\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_0,\\to_0)\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_1,\\to_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_0,\\to_0)\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_1,\\to_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_0\\to t_1\\to t_2\\to t_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_0\\to t_1\\to t_2\\to t_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:\\mathbb N\\to T,\\qquad\\gamma(n)\\coloneqq t_{n\\bmod3},\\qquad\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\gamma(n)\\to\\gamma(n+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma:\\mathbb N\\to T,\\qquad\\gamma(n)\\coloneqq t_{n\\bmod3},\\qquad\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\gamma(n)\\to\\gamma(n+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由本文件的规则与位置替换可以逐步核验所列三步环；其显式位置及替换见证见内部节点 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb7f59b6fc58cf0a\" href=\"?note=fb7f59b6fc58cf0a\" title=\"56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle\">56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle</a>。这些见证证明三个具体步，不依赖未提供的脚本或输出。两个分量 SN 是原书练习；本地证明如下。R₁ 每步选择一个真子项，项大小严格下降。R₀ 的规则保持被改写子项的根符号，变量和常元不归约。某 F 节点一旦根收缩，三个新子项最初相同，此后它们的根各自保持相同，因此不可能再次同时成为 0、1 和任意项，故该根至多收缩一次。按项高度归纳：根收缩前后都只有有限个严格较低高度的子项归约，根自身至多一步，所以无无限归约。该论证覆盖含变量项，而不仅是地面项。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4